   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f4b20799f5bc",
     "text": "When Do Disney Dining Reservations Open?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ac738715ff4c",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "036b8f4f5e3b",
     "text": "Disney's rule is simple: you can book starting 60 days ahead. To find your date, count back 60 days from the day you want to eat. A few examples:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "528a05792719",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "32ae3c3cb26c",
     "text": "Friday, January 15, 2027:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "42a3df54b296",
     "text": " book on Monday, November 16, 2026",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "01597540575b",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "22f7ebf37cd2",
     "text": "Sunday, February 14, 2027:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "3e8e249619ee",
     "text": " book on Wednesday, December 16, 2026",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "a15b7da0e924",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f431d0fd6610",
     "text": "Monday, March 15, 2027:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "98b60786b560",
     "text": " book on Thursday, January 14, 2027",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "8b303b1e4abe",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "746d2da059b8",
     "text": "Thursday, April 1, 2027:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9696ea5ff188",
     "text": " book on Sunday, January 31, 2027",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "d4399fba29ea",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "44b1f5e67b34",
     "text": "Tuesday, June 1, 2027:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ecb63d00d152",
     "text": " book on Friday, April 2, 2027",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "311270e545a6",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fca03512df0b",
     "text": "That's plain date math. Disney's booking page is the final word, so if a date doesn't show yet, check again the next morning. Windows open at about 6:00 AM Eastern, which is 5:00 AM if you live in Central time. Disney notes that delays are possible.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "591b9d20cf91",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1abd3749d514",
     "text": "Resort Guests vs. Off-Site Guests",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ad9375ef5712",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "bda92b830707",
     "text": "This is the biggest difference in how families book.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f64cd13063f6",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c3e655697e4d",
     "text": "Disney Resort hotel guests:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "90e0a40a16d7",
     "text": " starting 60 days before your ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b5d182f940ae",
     "text": "arrival",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f0488045ee3c",
     "text": " day, you can book dining for your entire stay, up to a 10-night stay. Disney points out that this lets you make all your reservations on the same day instead of checking day after day.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9743a52d3ec4",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "71dcba962eda",
     "text": "Everyone else:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c2346e004fc0",
     "text": " you can book starting 60 days in advance of each meal date.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "15c0da660ad8",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b21ba01076cb",
     "text": "So if you're staying off-site and want a character breakfast on the last day of your trip, that date opens later than your first day. Put a reminder on your calendar for each one.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ff47c8a8d11d",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f742bde26d75",
     "text": "Before You Book: Party Size, Tickets, and a Card",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "013e259f32d0",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6bc9f1da8fb0",
     "text": "Count everyone, including babies.",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fe4526273885",
     "text": " For in-park table-service restaurants, Disney \"highly recommends\" a confirmed reservation for the total number of guests, regardless of age. Put toddlers and babies in your party count.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "b9c372ff57d0",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "3a7b8c9d1c3e",
     "href": "/deals/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5f13f9b686e0",
     "text": "In-park meals need park admission.",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ad025d3b730a",
     "text": " Valid theme park admission is required to dine inside a park. A dining reservation doesn't guarantee park entry, and Disney says theme park reservations may be required depending on your ticket type. Compare tickets on our ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2f4c78211cc6",
     "text": "ticket deals page",
     "marks": [
      "3a7b8c9d1c3e"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "39b225f051bf",
     "text": " before your 60-day window opens.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f7e958328ae2",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c957db79474c",
     "text": "Resort meals are outside the parks.",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "16c581d26632",
     "text": " For Disney Resort hotel restaurants, Disney encourages all guests to make reservations. Chef Mickey's, ʻOhana breakfast, 1900 Park Fare, Topolino's Terrace breakfast, Cape May Cafe breakfast, and Story Book Dining are all at resort hotels.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "6e585544a449",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8f9e4c33fc82",
     "text": "Have a credit card ready.",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d70e491a375c",
     "text": " Disney's restaurant pages say the card you give when booking is charged a per-person fee if you don't show up or don't cancel in time.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9d35aafa7d81",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4fca05e992a4",
     "text": "Disney Dining Cancellation Policy",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "dc3875cb855f",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "ea7f716f9be6",
     "href": "https://disneyworld.disney.go.com/faq/dining-reservations/restaurant-reservation-cancellation/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ee5d37e4a09d",
     "text": "From ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f50e332c2388",
     "text": "Disney's cancellation FAQ",
     "marks": [
      "ea7f716f9be6"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "327190c91536",
     "text": " on November 2, 2026:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "b3c51a154161",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "980a2715873d",
     "text": "Most restaurants:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "bcb9714b14ae",
     "text": " you can cancel or change online. Restaurants that take advance reservations don't allow changes within 2 hours of your time, and most charge ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ebb9b9d20771",
     "text": "$10 per person",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "833e07a48c10",
     "text": " if you cancel within 2 hours or don't show up.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0bc63606f366",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "74ef3f796cae",
     "text": "Cinderella's Royal Table:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "54795d996aa9",
     "text": " once confirmed, the reservation ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "de35b7c6b0f3",
     "text": "can't be modified",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "afef2125f634",
     "text": ". To avoid paying the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4e323eaa80a9",
     "text": "full cost of the experience per person",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7c38d8fcf688",
     "text": ", cancel at least 2 hours before your reservation time.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0052e0fa88b1",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "13d1f9ef73f3",
     "text": "Check your confirmation email.",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1ece8825dee7",
     "text": " Disney gives each restaurant's policy when you book and in the confirmation email.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "c38d11c3b11f",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e4499f41007f",
     "text": "When someone cancels, Disney says the time goes straight back into the booking system for other guests. If the meal you want is full, keep checking. Spots can open up as plans change.",
     "marks": []
