     "text": "Animal Kingdom rides under 40 inches",
     "marks": [
      "5d47e9eda979"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8515ed3a84a2",
     "text": " or ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e9efbec32915",
     "text": "Animal Kingdom with kids",
     "marks": [
      "34632d1fad27"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b4e6ddc23c17",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "6cc7a3fa0fa1",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "b3c24fbf57f7",
     "href": "/parks/"
    },
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "d5965edb2ad3",
     "href": "/rides/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c9916950748b",
     "text": "Not sure which parks fit your kids? Start with the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6bc63999f661",
     "text": "park chooser",
     "marks": [
      "b3c24fbf57f7"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5fddeac37d04",
     "text": ", or use the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7671a6ef8f4b",
     "text": "ride finder",
     "marks": [
      "d5965edb2ad3"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d498ce9fa438",
     "text": " to filter every Disney World ride by your child's height. Your kids will be so excited when the characters come around the table, and a little planning keeps the rest of the day just as fun.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "48a1705cf240",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b981c9d438ed",
     "text": "Character Dining Booking FAQ",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "412b62650497",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2271d072ca68",
     "text": "How far in advance can you book Disney character dining?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ff15931c3cf2",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a5898305d2a4",
     "text": "60 days ahead. Disney Resort hotel guests can book their whole stay, up to a 10-night stay, at 60 days before arrival. Everyone else books each date 60 days ahead.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "b9139cc492c2",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5d37e86ac5d8",
     "text": "What time do Disney dining reservations open?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "b99d3fdf518a",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fc8d4e103ff7",
     "text": "At about 6:00 AM each day, per Disney's FAQ. Disney World is on Eastern time, so that's 5:00 AM Central.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f26c427c8746",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a26542a6fe28",
     "text": "Do I need to include my baby in the reservation?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "3737cabccd3a",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f0018ec651f2",
     "text": "For in-park table-service restaurants, Disney highly recommends a reservation for the total number of guests, regardless of age. Count babies and toddlers.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "05291bca031e",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1d02f236179c",
     "text": "What is the Disney dining cancellation fee?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "7c31f878695a",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ddf444b60c75",
     "text": "Most restaurants charge $10 per person if you cancel within 2 hours of your reservation or don't show up. Cinderella's Royal Table charges the full cost per person unless you cancel at least 2 hours before.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "2febafcdbd07",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "214eacb9a10e",
     "text": "Can I change my Cinderella's Royal Table reservation?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "dfc31cf952b8",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0605625d6760",
     "text": "No. Disney's FAQ says that once it's confirmed, the reservation can't be modified. You would need to cancel (at least 2 hours ahead to avoid the fee) and book again if a new time is available.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "a38c6536fea9",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "99cfbfd22177",
     "text": "Do I need a park ticket for character dining?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ca70c4729988",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7b865ccc6c3e",
     "text": "For meals inside a park, yes. Valid theme park admission is required. Resort hotel character meals like Chef Mickey's, ʻOhana breakfast, and Cape May Cafe breakfast are outside the parks.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9fae248bea70",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "75b8b72e7eba",
     "text": "Can I call to book Disney dining?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "2d411f5e884a",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "684ae1077640",
     "text": "Disney asks guests to book dining online. For extra help with an existing reservation, its cancellation FAQ lists (407) WDW-DINE, or (407) 939-3463. Guests under 18 need a parent or guardian's permission to call.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}